From ff91c24362704e69fbbb1c5a9cee40770ba65e75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 21:51:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(rfork): avoid overlapping draft memory registration

Exclude target-model weight regions when registering RFork draft weights so HCCL does not reject overlapping device memory. Keep seed manifests and receiver transfers aligned, and cover the draft worker propagation and interval handling with unit tests.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
